  "conclusion": "IMU and RSSI features have near-zero correlation with FTM noise and DO NOT improve denoising performance. Adding IMU features degrades equiv_alpha by 0.010-0.017. FTM noise is dominated by environmental multipath, not phone motion. Further denoising improvement requires architectural changes or different approach, not more input features."
